  "details": "I would like to see a setting to tweak walk speed in VR. Right now it’s too easy to click on run instead of trying to place the finger in right range of space to do a walk. Because it’s inconsistent to get the right space between walking and running I sometimes just keep tapping the walk/run button to have a kind of slower but jerky walk pace. Yes, some players love running in the racing worlds but if I am in a chill out world which is the grand majority of the worlds, I am often walking too fast for my liking.",
